            "activity_label": {
                "fi": "Tiistain esityslista \u2013 PfE-ryhm\u00e4n pyynt\u00f6 \u2013 Yhden Euroopan yhdet markkinat",
                "da": "Tirsdagens dagsord \u2013 Anmodning fra PfE-Gruppen \u2013 \"\u00c9t Europa, \u00e9t marked\"",
                "es": "Orden del d\u00eda del martes - Solicitud del Grupo\u00a0PfE - \u00abUna Europa, un mercado\u00bb",
                "de": "Tagesordnung f\u00fcr Dienstag\u00a0\u2013 Antrag der PfE-Fraktion \u2013 \u201eEin Europa, ein Markt\u201c",
                "en": "Tuesday\u2019s agenda \u2013 Request by the PfE Group \u2013 \u2018One Europe, one market\u2019",
                "el": "\u0397\u03bc\u03b5\u03c1\u03ae\u03c3\u03b9\u03b1 \u03b4\u03b9\u03ac\u03c4\u03b1\u03be\u03b7 \u03a4\u03c1\u03af\u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u2013 \u0391\u03af\u03c4\u03b7\u03bc\u03b1 \u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u039f\u03bc\u03ac\u03b4\u03b1\u03c2 PfE \u2013 \u00ab\u039c\u03af\u03b1 \u0395\u03c5\u03c1\u03ce\u03c0\u03b7, \u03bc\u03af\u03b1 \u03b1\u03b3\u03bf\u03c1\u03ac\u00bb",
                "sk": "Program utorkov\u00e9ho rokovania \u2013 Jedna Eur\u00f3pa, jeden trh",
                "lv": "Otrdienas darba k\u0101rt\u012bba - PfE grupas piepras\u012bjums - \u201cViena Eiropa, viens tirgus\u201d",
                "it": "Ordine del giorno di marted\u00ec \u2013 Richiesta del gruppo PfE \u2013 \"Un'Europa, un mercato\"",
                "mt": "A\u0121enda tat-Tlieta - Talba tal-Grupp PfE - \u201cEwropa Wa\u0127da, Suq Wie\u0127ed\u201d",
                "pt": "Ordem do dia de ter\u00e7a-feira \u2014 Pedido do Grupo PfE \u2014 \u00abUma Europa, um Mercado\u00bb",
                "sv": "Tisdagens f\u00f6redragningslista \u2013 beg\u00e4ran fr\u00e5n PfE-gruppen \u2013 \u201dEtt Europa, en marknad\u201d",
                "et": "Teisip\u00e4eva p\u00e4evakord \u2013 fraktsiooni PfE taotlus \u2013 \u201e\u00dcks Euroopa, \u00fcks turg\u201c",
                "sl": "Torkov dnevni red \u2013 zahteva skupine PfE \u2013 Ena Evropa, en trg",
                "hu": "Keddi napirend \u2013 a PfE k\u00e9pvisel\u0151csoport k\u00e9relme \u2013 \u201eEgy Eur\u00f3pa, egy piac\u201d",
                "nl": "Agenda van dinsdag \u2013 Verzoek van de PfE-Fractie \u2013 \u201cE\u00e9n Europa, \u00e9\u00e9n markt\u201d",
                "bg": "\u0414\u043d\u0435\u0432\u0435\u043d \u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0437\u0430 \u0432\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043d\u0438\u043a - \u0418\u0441\u043a\u0430\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043f\u0430\u0442\u0430 PfE \u2013 \u201e\u0415\u0434\u043d\u0430 \u0415\u0432\u0440\u043e\u043f\u0430, \u0435\u0434\u0438\u043d \u043f\u0430\u0437\u0430\u0440\u201c",
                "ro": "Ordinea de zi de mar\u021bi \u2013 Cererea Grupului PfE \u2013 \u201eO Europ\u0103, o pia\u021b\u0103\u201d",
                "hr": "Dnevni red za utorak \u2013 Zahtjev Kluba zastupnika PfE-a \u2013 \u201eJedna Europa, jedno tr\u017ei\u0161te\u201d",
                "mul": "Ordre du jour de mardi - Demande du groupe PfE - \"Une Europe, un march\u00e9\"",
                "fr": "Ordre du jour de mardi - Demande du groupe PfE - \"Une Europe, un march\u00e9\"",
                "cs": "\u00datern\u00ed po\u0159ad jedn\u00e1n\u00ed \u2013 \u017e\u00e1dost skupiny PfE \u2013 \u201eJedna Evropa, jeden trh\u201c",
                "pl": "Porz\u0105dek obrad we wtorek \u2013 wniosek grupy PfE \u2013 \u201eJedna Europa, jeden rynek\u201d",
                "ga": "Cl\u00e1r Oibre \u2013 D\u00e9 M\u00e1irt \u2013 Iarraidh \u00f3n nGr\u00fapa PfE \u2013 \u2018Aon Eoraip Amh\u00e1in, Aon Mhargadh Amh\u00e1in\u2019",
